<div class="section_content content" id="51420528_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">It is found and declared that:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420529"><a alt="363-1A" class="litem_number" href="51420529#51420529" onclick="return false;" title="363-1A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The business of vending merchandise and refreshments in the public streets, sidewalks, places and from door to door in the City of Albany should be regulated to protect the public health, safety and welfare of the inhabitants of the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420530"><a alt="363-1B" class="litem_number" href="51420530#51420530" onclick="return false;" title="363-1B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Reasonable regulation of vending is necessary for the prevention of congestion of traffic and travel.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420531"><a alt="363-1C" class="litem_number" href="51420531#51420531" onclick="return false;" title="363-1C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Persons engaged in the business of vending should be required to be licensed and to furnish such information as necessary to effectively carry out the purposes of this chapter.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420532"><a alt="363-1D" class="litem_number" href="51420532#51420532" onclick="return false;" title="363-1D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Unless specifically authorized by this chapter, vending in the City of Albany within any public right-of-way, sidewalk or place is prohibited.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420533"
      id="51420533"
      data-guid="51420533"
      data-position="8506"
      data-full-title="§ 363-2: Definitions."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420533_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420533_label" for="51420533_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420533"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-2
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420533"
    >
Definitions.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420533" data-guid="51420533"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420533" data-guid="51420533" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420533_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">As used in this chapter, the following terms shall have the meanings indicated:</div><section class="definition" id="51420534"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420534#51420534" onclick="return false;">CITY CLERK</a></dfn><div class="deftext">The City Clerk of the City of Albany.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420535"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420535#51420535" onclick="return false;">HEALTHY PRODUCTS</a></dfn><div class="deflevel"><section class="defitem" id="51420536"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420536#51420536">A. </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">Healthy products shall be labeled in accordance with New York State Department of Agriculture and Markets regulations and shall consist of the following:</div><div class="deflevel"><section class="defitem" id="51420537"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420537#51420537">(1) </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">Unprocessed raw fruits and vegetables that have not been combined with other ingredients;</div></div></section><section class="defitem" id="51420538"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420538#51420538">(2) </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">Prepackaged raw, cut or sliced fruits or vegetables, which may include dried herbs and spices;</div></div></section><section class="defitem" id="51420539"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420539#51420539">(3) </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">Prepackaged still or carbonated water, which may contain flavoring or minerals but does not contain sodium or natural or artificial sweeteners and must have zero calories; and</div></div></section><section class="defitem" id="51420540"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420540#51420540">(4) </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">Raw, single-ingredient nuts; shelled nuts must be prepackaged.</div></div></section></div></div></section><section class="defitem" id="51420541"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420541#51420541">B. </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">In no case shall healthy products:</div><div class="deflevel"><section class="defitem" id="51420542"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420542#51420542">(1) </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">Be cooked, grilled, baked, fried, cured, pickled, or prepared in any other manner, except as permitted by this definition; or</div></div></section><section class="defitem" id="51420543"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420543#51420543">(2) </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">Be processed or multi-ingredient foods, including baked goods, candy, chips, prepared meals, juices, smoothies, or other non-zero calorie food or beverage; or</div></div></section><section class="defitem" id="51420544"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420544#51420544">(3) </a><div class="defitem_content content"><div class="para">Contain added sodium, added natural or artificial sweeteners, or added artificial ingredients or preservatives.</div></div></section></div></div></section></div></section><section class="definition" id="51420545"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420545#51420545" onclick="return false;">LICENSE</a></dfn><div class="deftext">A license issued pursuant to this chapter.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420546"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420546#51420546" onclick="return false;">LICENSEE</a></dfn><div class="deftext">Any person holding a license.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420547"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420547#51420547" onclick="return false;">MERCHANDISE</a></dfn><div class="deftext">Any nonedible commodity or service, including but not limited to flowers, balloons, hair design, or cosmetology.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420548"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420548#51420548" onclick="return false;">PERSON</a></dfn><div class="deftext">Includes any individual, society, club, firm, partnership, corporation or association of persons.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420549"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420549#51420549" onclick="return false;">PURCHASE</a></dfn><div class="deftext">To obtain merchandise in exchange for money or its equivalent. The act or an instance of buying merchandise on the public streets, sidewalks or places or from door to door in the City of Albany.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420550"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420550#51420550" onclick="return false;">PURCHASER</a></dfn><div class="deftext">Any person engaged in the buying of merchandise, by means of money or its equivalent, on the public streets, sidewalks or places in the City of Albany.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420551"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420551#51420551" onclick="return false;">REFRESHMENT</a></dfn><div class="deftext">Any prepared edible or potable commodity which does not fit the definition for a healthy product.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420552"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420552#51420552" onclick="return false;">REFRESHMENT BUSINESS OR STAND</a></dfn><div class="deftext">Any place or location where is sold, or any place or location where it is proposed to sell or offer for sale at retail for consumption off the premises or location, either as a separate business or in connection with any other business, any refreshment. There shall be three types of "refreshment businesses or stands" as follows:</div><div class="deflevel"><section class="defitem" id="51420553"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420553#51420553">A. </a><div class="defitem_content content"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420553#51420553" onclick="return false;">CURBSIDE VENDOR</a></dfn><div class="deftext">A vendor who parks a motor vehicle at the licensed location in connection with the operation of one refreshment business or stand, whether the vehicle serves as the refreshment stand or not.</div></div></section><section class="defitem" id="51420554"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420554#51420554">B. </a><div class="defitem_content content"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420554#51420554" onclick="return false;">SIDEWALK VENDOR</a></dfn><div class="deftext">A vendor who operates and locates one refreshment business or stand on the sidewalk only and who does not park a motor vehicle at the licensed location.</div></div></section><section class="defitem" id="51420555"><a class="defitem_number" href="51420555#51420555">C. </a><div class="defitem_content content"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420555#51420555" onclick="return false;">ICE CREAM TRUCK VENDOR</a></dfn><div class="deftext">A vendor who sells ice cream as a primary product from one motor vehicle and along the public streets.</div></div></section></div></section><section class="definition" id="51420556"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420556#51420556" onclick="return false;">VEND</a></dfn><div class="deftext">The act of selling or offering for sale, or the act of purchasing or offering to purchase for commercial purposes, refreshments or merchandise on the public streets, sidewalks or places or from door to door in the City of Albany, from a stand, motor vehicle or from the person.</div></section><section class="definition" id="51420557"><dfn class="term"><a class="termLink" href="51420557#51420557" onclick="return false;">VENDOR</a></dfn><div class="deftext">Any person engaged in the selling or offering for sale, or engaged in purchasing or offering to purchase for commercial purposes, of refreshments or merchandise on the public streets, sidewalks or places or from door to door in the City of Albany, from a stand, motor vehicle or from the person.</div></section><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420558"
      id="51420558"
      data-guid="51420558"
      data-position="8531"
      data-full-title="§ 363-3: Rules and regulations."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420558_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420558_label" for="51420558_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420558"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-3
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420558"
    >
Rules and regulations.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420558" data-guid="51420558"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420558" data-guid="51420558" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420558_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The City Clerk, with the advice of the Chief of Police or their designee, may promulgate rules and regulations necessary to effectuate the provisions of this chapter. Special rules and regulations issued by the City Clerk may supersede otherwise inconsistent provisions of this chapter.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420559"
      id="51420559"
      data-guid="51420559"
      data-position="8532"
      data-full-title="§ 363-4: License required; methods of vending restricted; authority to limit number of licenses."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420559_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420559_label" for="51420559_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420559"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-4
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420559"
    >
License required; methods of vending restricted; authority to limit number of licenses.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420559" data-guid="51420559"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420559" data-guid="51420559" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420559_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420560"><a alt="363-4A" class="litem_number" href="51420560#51420560" onclick="return false;" title="363-4A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">It shall be unlawful for any person to vend in the City of Albany without a license, except that within an area extending six feet into the public right of way abutting a property, vending shall be permitted with the written consent of the property owner.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420561"><a alt="363-4B" class="litem_number" href="51420561#51420561" onclick="return false;" title="363-4B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">It shall be unlawful to vend merchandise, except flowers and balloons, other than from door to door.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420562"><a alt="363-4C" class="litem_number" href="51420562#51420562" onclick="return false;" title="363-4C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The City Clerk is hereby authorized to limit the number of refreshment business or stand licenses.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420563"
      id="51420563"
      data-guid="51420563"
      data-position="8536"
      data-full-title="§ 363-5: License fees."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420563_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420563_label" for="51420563_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420563"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-5
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420563"
    >
License fees.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420563" data-guid="51420563"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420563" data-guid="51420563" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420563_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">License fees shall be payable in full upon application for said license and shall be as follows:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420564"><a alt="363-5A" class="litem_number" href="51420564#51420564" onclick="return false;" title="363-5A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">To vend refreshments:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420565"><a alt="363-5A(1)" class="litem_number" href="51420565#51420565" onclick="return false;" title="363-5A(1)">(1) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Curbside vendor: $2,000 per year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420566"><a alt="363-5A(2)" class="litem_number" href="51420566#51420566" onclick="return false;" title="363-5A(2)">(2) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Sidewalk vendor: $1,000 per year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420567"><a alt="363-5A(3)" class="litem_number" href="51420567#51420567" onclick="return false;" title="363-5A(3)">(3) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Ice cream truck vendor: $1,000 per year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420568"><a alt="363-5B" class="litem_number" href="51420568#51420568" onclick="return false;" title="363-5B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">To vend flowers: $400 per year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420569"><a alt="363-5C" class="litem_number" href="51420569#51420569" onclick="return false;" title="363-5C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">To vend balloons: $100 per year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420570"><a alt="363-5D" class="litem_number" href="51420570#51420570" onclick="return false;" title="363-5D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">To vend merchandise from door to door: $250 per year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420571"><a alt="363-5E" class="litem_number" href="51420571#51420571" onclick="return false;" title="363-5E">E. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">To vend merchandise from a vehicle: $750 per year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420572"><a alt="363-5F" class="litem_number" href="51420572#51420572" onclick="return false;" title="363-5F">F. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">To vend healthy products: $100 per year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420573"
      id="51420573"
      data-guid="51420573"
      data-position="8546"
      data-full-title="§ 363-6: General requirements."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420573_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420573_label" for="51420573_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420573"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-6
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420573"
    >
General requirements.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420573" data-guid="51420573"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420573" data-guid="51420573" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420573_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420574"><a alt="363-6A" class="litem_number" href="51420574#51420574" onclick="return false;" title="363-6A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">All vendors are prohibited from vending in a manner that interferes with pedestrian or vehicular traffic or other legitimate business in the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420575"><a alt="363-6B" class="litem_number" href="51420575#51420575" onclick="return false;" title="363-6B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">No vendor shall, directly or indirectly, cause or permit the public streets, sidewalks or places to be littered with papers, wrappings or other debris or refuse where the littering results from the conduct of their business.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420576"><a alt="363-6C" class="litem_number" href="51420576#51420576" onclick="return false;" title="363-6C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">No vendor shall vend between 2:00 a.m. and 7:00 a.m. unless otherwise specified.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420577"><a alt="363-6D" class="litem_number" href="51420577#51420577" onclick="return false;" title="363-6D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Persons licensed pursuant to the provisions of § <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/GBS/32" target="_blank">32</a> of the General Business Law of the State of New York shall be prohibited from vending within the City of Albany unless they have obtained a license in accordance with the provisions of this chapter.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420578"><a alt="363-6E" class="litem_number" href="51420578#51420578" onclick="return false;" title="363-6E">E. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any person vending refreshments or merchandise from a motor vehicle that is attractive to and popular with children, which invites or causes children to gather or collect about the motor vehicle, is required to take those precautions necessary to protect the children from being struck by motor vehicles.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420579"><a alt="363-6F" class="litem_number" href="51420579#51420579" onclick="return false;" title="363-6F">F. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">No vendor shall use or operate any loudspeaker, public address system, radio, sound amplifier or similar device to attract the attention of the public.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420580"><a alt="363-6G" class="litem_number" href="51420580#51420580" onclick="return false;" title="363-6G">G. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">No vendor shall vend within 1,000 feet of the grounds of any elementary or secondary school between 1/2 hour prior to the start of the school day and 1/2 hour after dismissal at the end of the school day.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420581"
      id="51420581"
      data-guid="51420581"
      data-position="8554"
      data-full-title="§ 363-7: Requirements for vendors of refreshments, healthy products, flowers or balloons."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420581_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420581_label" for="51420581_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420581"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-7
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420581"
    >
Requirements for vendors of refreshments, healthy products, flowers or balloons.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420581" data-guid="51420581"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420581" data-guid="51420581" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420581_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420582"><a alt="363-7A" class="litem_number" href="51420582#51420582" onclick="return false;" title="363-7A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">A licensed vendor of refreshments, healthy products, flowers, or balloons shall be authorized to vend at any location within the City of Albany in accordance with this chapter and all applicable laws and regulations.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420583"><a alt="363-7B" class="litem_number" href="51420583#51420583" onclick="return false;" title="363-7B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The license may limit the amount of space to be occupied by the vendor.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420584"><a alt="363-7C" class="litem_number" href="51420584#51420584" onclick="return false;" title="363-7C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Vendors at special events, events not exceeding three days in duration, shall be exempt from their location requirement. Such vendors shall comply with all applicable provisions of this chapter and rules and regulations issued pursuant to it and pay all fees as required by the person coordinating the special event.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420585"><a alt="363-7D" class="litem_number" href="51420585#51420585" onclick="return false;" title="363-7D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Ice cream truck vendors shall be permitted in the residential zones of the City in accordance with any rules and regulations promulgated by the City Clerk.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420586"
      id="51420586"
      data-guid="51420586"
      data-position="8559"
      data-full-title="§ 363-8: Requirements for vendors of merchandise using a vehicle for vending."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420586_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420586_label" for="51420586_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420586"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-8
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420586"
    >
Requirements for vendors of merchandise using a vehicle for vending.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420586" data-guid="51420586"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420586" data-guid="51420586" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420586_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420587"><a alt="363-8A" class="litem_number" href="51420587#51420587" onclick="return false;" title="363-8A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Unless otherwise provided, a licensed vendor of merchandise using a vehicle for said purpose shall be authorized to operate at a specific location in the City of Albany. The license shall specify the location from which purchasing is permitted and shall only be valid for purchasing at that location. There shall only be one vehicle in a designated location.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420588"><a alt="363-8B" class="litem_number" href="51420588#51420588" onclick="return false;" title="363-8B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The license may limit the amount of space to be occupied.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420589"
      id="51420589"
      data-guid="51420589"
      data-position="8562"
      data-full-title="§ 363-9: Requirements for door-to-door vendors."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420589_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420589_label" for="51420589_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420589"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-9
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420589"
    >
Requirements for door-to-door vendors.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420589" data-guid="51420589"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420589" data-guid="51420589" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420589_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420590"><a alt="363-9A" class="litem_number" href="51420590#51420590" onclick="return false;" title="363-9A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">No door-to-door vendor shall enter any house, building or premises where there is posted on the front of the house, building or premises a written notice stating that vendors are not desired, unless the vendor has received the prior consent of the occupant.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420591"><a alt="363-9B" class="litem_number" href="51420591#51420591" onclick="return false;" title="363-9B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">No door-to-door vendor shall make false statements or misrepresentations in the course of their activities. The vendor shall conduct themselves at all times in an orderly and lawful manner.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420592"><a alt="363-9C" class="litem_number" href="51420592#51420592" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any person desiring to act as a door-to-door vendor in the City of Albany shall first obtain a license to vend door-to-door in accordance with the following provisions:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420593"><a alt="363-9C(1)" class="litem_number" href="51420593#51420593" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)">(1) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any person seeking a license to vend door-to-door shall file with the City Clerk an application upon a form furnished by the City Clerk. Such application shall require the applicant to provide:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420594"><a alt="363-9C(1)(a)" class="litem_number" href="51420594#51420594" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(a)">(a) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The number and kind of vehicle to be used by the applicant, if any, in carrying on the business for which the license is desired.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420595"><a alt="363-9C(1)(b)" class="litem_number" href="51420595#51420595" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(b)">(b) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The kind of goods, wares, and merchandise the applicant intends to sell or the kind of service the applicant intends to perform.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420596"><a alt="363-9C(1)(c)" class="litem_number" href="51420596#51420596" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(c)">(c) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The method of distribution for such goods or services.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420597"><a alt="363-9C(1)(d)" class="litem_number" href="51420597#51420597" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(d)">(d) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The name, address, and date of birth of the applicant.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420598"><a alt="363-9C(1)(e)" class="litem_number" href="51420598#51420598" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(e)">(e) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">A statement as to whether the applicant has been convicted of a crime, and if so, the date of conviction(s), the name of the crime(s) of which the applicant was convicted, the penalty imposed for the conviction(s), and the name(s) and address(es) of the court(s) in which the applicant was convicted.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420599"><a alt="363-9C(1)(f)" class="litem_number" href="51420599#51420599" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(f)">(f) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The name and address of the person, firm, or corporation that the applicant represents.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420600"><a alt="363-9C(1)(g)" class="litem_number" href="51420600#51420600" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(g)">(g) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The length of time for which the applicant desires the license.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420601"><a alt="363-9C(1)(h)" class="litem_number" href="51420601#51420601" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(h)">(h) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Fingerprints in the form and manner prescribed by the New York State Division of Criminal Justice Services ("DCJS"), along with any applicable fees required by DCJS.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420602"><a alt="363-9C(1)(i)" class="litem_number" href="51420602#51420602" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(1)(i)">(i) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Such other information as the City Clerk may require to substantiate the above items.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420603"><a alt="363-9C(2)" class="litem_number" href="51420603#51420603" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(2)">(2) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The City Clerk shall forward the applicant's fingerprints and any applicable fees to DCJS in the form and manner as prescribed by DCJS for a complete history record check.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420604"><a alt="363-9C(3)" class="litem_number" href="51420604#51420604" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(3)">(3) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The Corporation Counsel shall review all information provided by DCJS in connection with any applicant's criminal history and shall determine whether any such convictions render an applicant unfit to carry out the duties of a door-to-door vendor. In making such determinations, the Corporation Counsel shall give due consideration to the provisions of §§ 701 through 703-b and §§ <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/COR/751" target="_blank">751</a> through <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/COR/753" target="_blank">753</a> of the New York State Correction Law.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420605"><a alt="363-9C(4)" class="litem_number" href="51420605#51420605" onclick="return false;" title="363-9C(4)">(4) </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">If an applicant's application is approved, the applicant shall only be entitled to engage in the sale of the merchandise or services listed in the applicant's application.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420606"
      id="51420606"
      data-guid="51420606"
      data-position="8579"
      data-full-title="§ 363-10: Exemptions."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420606_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420606_label" for="51420606_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420606"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-10
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420606"
    >
Exemptions.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420606" data-guid="51420606"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420606" data-guid="51420606" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420606_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The following persons shall not be required to obtain a license:</div><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420607"><a alt="363-10A" class="litem_number" href="51420607#51420607" onclick="return false;" title="363-10A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Individuals under the age of 16 years who vend edible or potable goods.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420608"
      id="51420608"
      data-guid="51420608"
      data-position="8581"
      data-full-title="§ 363-11: Term and form of license."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420608_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420608_label" for="51420608_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420608"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-11
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420608"
    >
Term and form of license.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420608" data-guid="51420608"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420608" data-guid="51420608" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420608_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420609"><a alt="363-11A" class="litem_number" href="51420609#51420609" onclick="return false;" title="363-11A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">If the City Clerk approves an application, the license shall be valid for one calendar year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420610"><a alt="363-11B" class="litem_number" href="51420610#51420610" onclick="return false;" title="363-11B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">A license shall be in a form prescribed by the City Clerk.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420611"
      id="51420611"
      data-guid="51420611"
      data-position="8584"
      data-full-title="§ 363-12: Nonissuance of license."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420611_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420611_label" for="51420611_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420611"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-12
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420611"
    >
Nonissuance of license.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420611" data-guid="51420611"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420611" data-guid="51420611" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420611_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">No license shall be issued to any applicant if the business sought to be licensed does not comply with all applicable federal, state and local laws, ordinances and regulations. If the application is rejected, the City Clerk shall notify the applicant, in writing, giving the reasons for the rejection.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420612"
      id="51420612"
      data-guid="51420612"
      data-position="8585"
      data-full-title="§ 363-13: Display of licenses."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420612_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420612_label" for="51420612_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420612"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-13
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420612"
    >
Display of licenses.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420612" data-guid="51420612"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420612" data-guid="51420612" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420612_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">All licenses shall be displayed in a conspicuous place at all times during the operation of the vending business.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420613"
      id="51420613"
      data-guid="51420613"
      data-position="8586"
      data-full-title="§ 363-14: Transfer of license."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420613_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420613_label" for="51420613_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420613"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-14
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420613"
    >
Transfer of license.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420613" data-guid="51420613"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420613" data-guid="51420613" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420613_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">A license may not be transferred or assigned or its location changed without prior approval of the City Clerk. If the City Clerk approves the transfer, assignment or location change, this action shall be endorsed upon the license by the City Clerk.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420614"
      id="51420614"
      data-guid="51420614"
      data-position="8587"
      data-full-title="§ 363-15: Renewal of license."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420614_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420614_label" for="51420614_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420614"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-15
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420614"
    >
Renewal of license.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420614" data-guid="51420614"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420614" data-guid="51420614" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420614_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">A license may be renewed at its expiration by submitting a new application form.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420615"
      id="51420615"
      data-guid="51420615"
      data-position="8588"
      data-full-title="§ 363-16: Suspension or revocation of license."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420615_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420615_label" for="51420615_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420615"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-16
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420615"
    >
Suspension or revocation of license.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420615" data-guid="51420615"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420615" data-guid="51420615" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420615_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420616"><a alt="363-16A" class="litem_number" href="51420616#51420616" onclick="return false;" title="363-16A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">A license may be suspended or revoked by the City Clerk only after notice, in writing, and an opportunity to be heard is given to the vendor.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420617"><a alt="363-16B" class="litem_number" href="51420617#51420617" onclick="return false;" title="363-16B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Written notice of intent to suspend or revoke shall be given by registered or certified mail, to the address set forth on the application.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420618"><a alt="363-16C" class="litem_number" href="51420618#51420618" onclick="return false;" title="363-16C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">The City Clerk shall suspend or revoke the license of any vendor found to have violated or to have permitted a violation of any provision of this chapter or any other ordinance, rule or regulation or state or federal law pertaining to the operation of their business.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420619"><a alt="363-16D" class="litem_number" href="51420619#51420619" onclick="return false;" title="363-16D">D. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Upon a determination that a license should be suspended or revoked, the City Clerk shall notify the vendor, in writing, setting forth reasons for such suspension or revocation.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420620"
      id="51420620"
      data-guid="51420620"
      data-position="8593"
      data-full-title="§ 363-17: Effect of license revocation."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420620_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420620_label" for="51420620_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420620"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-17
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420620"
    >
Effect of license revocation.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420620" data-guid="51420620"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420620" data-guid="51420620" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420620_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420621"><a alt="363-17A" class="litem_number" href="51420621#51420621" onclick="return false;" title="363-17A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">When a license has been revoked, no other license shall be issued to the same vendor until after the expiration of at least one year.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420622"><a alt="363-17B" class="litem_number" href="51420622#51420622" onclick="return false;" title="363-17B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Upon revocation of any license, the license fee shall be forfeited.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 51420623"
      id="51420623"
      data-guid="51420623"
      data-position="8596"
      data-full-title="§ 363-18: Penalties for offenses."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="51420623_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="51420623_label" for="51420623_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#51420623"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 363-18
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="51420623"
    >
Penalties for offenses.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-51420623" data-guid="51420623"></div>
        <div id="questions-51420623" data-guid="51420623" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="51420623_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="51420624"><a alt="363-18A" class="litem_number" href="51420624#51420624" onclick="return false;" title="363-18A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any person who conducts a business without a license required by this chapter or who conducts or attempts to conduct a business during the period when their license is suspended or revoked or who violates any of the terms or provisions of this chapter shall be guilty of a violation.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420625"><a alt="363-18B" class="litem_number" href="51420625#51420625" onclick="return false;" title="363-18B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Any persons found guilty of a violation shall be liable to a fine which shall not exceed $350 in amount or to imprisonment not to exceed 15 days, or to both, in the discretion of the court.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="51420626"><a alt="363-18C" class="litem_number" href="51420626#51420626" onclick="return false;" title="363-18C">C. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">Except as otherwise provided by law, such violation shall not impose any disability upon or affect or impair the credibility as a witness or otherwise of any person found guilty of such offense.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
